BOTH ARE FAMOUS FOR BEING WONHEE'S FANS

40
00:01:50,694 --> 00:01:52,821
- So cute.
- Hello, Little Guinea Pig.

41
00:01:52,904 --> 00:01:54,656
- Hello.
- Hello.

