- Okay.

66
00:02:42,913 --> 00:02:43,914
Wonhee.

67
00:02:44,247 --> 00:02:46,291
- Wonhee.
- Call me whatever you want.

68
00:02:46,375 --> 00:02:49,127
MELTING RIGHT ON THE SPOT

69
00:02:49,211 --> 00:02:50,837
- You're so cute.
- So lovely.

70
00:02:50,921 --> 00:02:52,506
- So cute.
- Wait! I have an announcement.

71
00:02:52,589 --> 00:02:55,842
