I'm placing a ban on "so cute."

72
00:02:55,926 --> 00:02:58,512
Can I call you <i>oppa</i>, then? Wonhee <i>oppa</i>.

73
00:02:58,595 --> 00:03:00,347
- You don't have to, but...
- So cool.

74
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,933
- She likes the sound of that.
- So cute.

75
00:03:03,016 --> 00:03:05,686
SinB, I saw that video
where you said you wanted to raise me.

76
00:03:05,769 --> 00:03:07,062
