- Consider this.

78
00:03:08,772 --> 00:03:11,483
What if I keep bothering you
the moment you return home after work?

79
00:03:11,566 --> 00:03:13,443
- I mean--
- "Turn the lights off."

80
00:03:13,527 --> 00:03:14,653
Listen, Wonhee.

81
00:03:14,736 --> 00:03:17,489
I said I'd love to raise you
as my daughter.

82
00:03:17,572 --> 00:03:19,533
- I hear you're your mom's biggest fan.
- I am.

83
00:03:19,616 --> 00:03:22,369
That comment just fired me up even more.

84
00:03:22,452 --> 00:03:23,370
I see.

85
00:03:23,453 --> 00:03:25,372
I LOVE MY MOM

86
00:03:25,455 --> 00:03:27,040
You two have such different vibes.

87
00:03:27,124 --> 00:03:28,875
- I love how...
- Is it fun to compare?

88
00:03:28,959 --> 00:03:31,211
